test(ai): add the utility-bucket A/B harness used to settle the model choice

scripts/ai-utility-ab.mjs + npm run ai:ab-utility. Runs the three call shapes the
utility bucket actually uses — vision alt-text, schema-validated extraction with
a hallucination trap, and length-constrained SEO meta — against each candidate
model, using the real prompts and schemas copied from the routes.

Two real prod product images with known ground truth are used for the vision
test so output can be graded rather than eyeballed for plausibility. The
product-facts fixture states three of six requested spec labels; returning a
value for weight, warranty, or material is confabulation and is flagged.

Committed because the utility-bucket choice will be revisited whenever a
candidate model changes, and re-deriving the fixtures each time is wasted work.
Dev tool only — not imported by the app; makes a few cents of real calls.

